        <mxCell id="d5_cdn_note" value="Static content of the online store (product images, CSS, JS, fonts) is stored in object storage (S3 / MinIO) – the CDN origin – and served to users from the CDN edge server of their region. On a cache miss each edge pulls the file from the origin and caches it by TTL (Cache-Control); files have versioned names (app.3f2a.js), so a new release is picked up without purging. Dynamic requests (catalog, cart, orders) bypass the CDN and go to the API Gateway." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="330" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
